://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/82/rw2xl8g4ttd2rq80tu4nfr3s5tdebwx.png/120px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B_%E4%BC%8F%E5%87%BB%E4%B9%8B%E5%88%83.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/82/rw2xl8g4ttd2rq80tu4nfr3s5tdebwx.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />伏击之刃\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"天赋一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"攀爬\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">攀爬</font></span></span>]。攻击敌人[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">侧、后方</span>]时，暴击率提高<font color=\"red\">8%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%9B%87%E4%BD%A3%E5%88%BA%E5%AE%A2\" title=\"角色图鉴库/雇佣刺客\"><img alt=\"头像 雇佣刺客.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/fd/30z32dy6n32tsttpkhrsuvfblc42b6e.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">雇佣刺客</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"天赋二星.png\" src=\"https:/